cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit in preparing academic work, please cite it as follows."
title: "Ideal Chemistry Academic Writing"
abstract: >-
  A research-grade toolkit for writing, reviewing, and submitting chemistry
  manuscripts, theses, and peer reviews, built from an evidence base of 1,700+
  publications from the IISER Bhopal Department of Chemistry (257 journals) and
  publisher-verified author guidelines (ACS, RSC, Wiley-VCH).
keywords:
  - academic writing
  - chemistry
  - LaTeX templates
  - thesis template
  - peer review
  - research methodology
  - publishing
  - IISER Bhopal
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-08-08"
authors:
  - name: "IISER Bhopal Chemistry Writing Project"
    affiliation: "Department of Chemistry, IISER Bhopal"
